  "transport_defects_found_and_fixed": [
    "docker exec arguments beginning with a slash are rewritten by MSYS path conversion on Windows, so every container command is wrapped in sh -c; this is the defect class that produced the negative M070",
    "a fresh browser profile per action discarded localStorage, which would have left the harness holding the state instead of the browser; a persistent profile now keeps it",
    "passing the page through an environment variable required flattening it to one line, which turned a // comment into a comment over the whole script and disabled the save handler; the page is now written to a file"
  ],
